[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2446597422","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98667#issuecomment-2446597422","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98667","id":2446597422,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6R1B0u","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T11:00:28Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T11:00:48Z","body":"You basically took this [short Rocketchat chitchat](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/editor?msg=oXduvpHyW5brFasnB) at heart. This new class could be an outstanding starting point.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2446597422/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2446621376","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98667#issuecomment-2446621376","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98667","id":2446621376,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6R1HrA","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T11:05:40Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T11:06:37Z","body":"Not really, this was inspired by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96400#pullrequestreview-2301351811\r\nFor searching improvements, #98278 might be more helpful. Although the 2 classes could be combined I guess (i.e. FilterLineEdit with FuzzySearch).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2446621376/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2448172911","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98667#issuecomment-2448172911","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98667","id":2448172911,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6R7Cdv","user":{"login":"a-johnston","id":9058941,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTg5NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9058941?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston","html_url":"https://github.com/a-johnston","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T19:27:38Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T19:27:38Z","body":"I think the most related code in that PR is with `QuickOpenResultContainer` where the parent container determines if a given event goes to the LineEdit or grid/list navigation https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/562c666/editor/gui/editor_quick_open_dialog.cpp#L465-L487\r\n\r\nIf `FilterLineEdit` had additional configuration for passing along for example left/right with a specific modifier (or lack of modifier) it could be used in `QuickOpenResultContainer` (assuming we then update the config when grid/list views are selected). I don't know if that abstraction would be worthwhile (how often do we need to delegate between list/grid view while a text field is active?) but it's at least relevant to consider.\r\n\r\nIMO `FuzzySearch` benefits from not being tied explicitly to a node but if there is enough demand for a `LineEdit` or `ItemList` subclass which can do that sort of filtering, it maybe still makes sense to add a relatively lightweight class that then calls into `FuzzySearch`. Or maybe it's good enough to just be able to call into `FuzzySearch` off of text_changed/text_submitted like with https://github.com/a-johnston/godot/blob/3ac043c/editor/gui/editor_quick_open_dialog.cpp#L413-L423\r\n\r\nThe mentioned features in that rocketchat message could be valuable to add to FuzzySearch in any case - I like the idea of quoted tokens always using the exact match and normalizing accented characters etc.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2448172911/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2478456816","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98667#issuecomment-2478456816","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98667","id":2478456816,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Tuj_w","user":{"login":"Maran23","id":66004280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDA0Mjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66004280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23","html_url":"https://github.com/Maran23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-15T10:02:14Z","updated_at":"2024-11-15T10:02:14Z","body":"Branch has conflicts. Otherwise looks good to me and a nice c